unittest/compiler-fixtures/region-scope-free.x:14:3: after-free: 'p' is used after it was freed
    return result + *p;
    ^^^^^^

unittest/compiler-fixtures/region-scope-free.x:21:3: bad-free: Scope.free is given the address of 'x', which no Scope allocator returned
    Scope.free(&x);
    ^^^^^
  note: only Scope.malloc, calloc, memdup, and realloc storage can be freed or reallocated

unittest/compiler-fixtures/region-scope-free.x:22:3: bad-free: Scope.free is given 'p', which no Scope allocator returned
    Scope.free(p);
    ^^^^^
  note: only Scope.malloc, calloc, memdup, and realloc storage can be freed or reallocated

unittest/compiler-fixtures/region-scope-free.x:23:3: bad-free: Scope.free is given the address of 'local', which no Scope allocator returned
    Scope.free(local);
    ^^^^^
  note: only Scope.malloc, calloc, memdup, and realloc storage can be freed or reallocated

unittest/compiler-fixtures/region-scope-free.x:24:3: bad-free: Scope.realloc is given a literal, which no Scope allocator returned
